WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.936
Medication follows a justified clinical problem, not a single screen value. Low saturation does not automatically mean naloxone, nausea does not explain its own cause, and low blood pressure does not automatically mean tranexamic acid.
药物应对应有依据的临床问题，而非单个屏幕数字。低血氧不自动等于纳洛酮，恶心不能解释自身病因，低血压也不自动等于氨甲环酸。

00:00:15.936 --> 00:00:29.880
First support the immediate threat, then check whether the drug fits the history and examination. Verify contraindications and the actual license, endorsement, service authorization and supervision that apply.
先支持即时威胁，再查药物是否符合病史检查。核实禁忌及实际适用执照、附加权限、机构授权和督导要求。

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:40.200
A school module can teach a drug before the weekend where hands-on administration is assessed. Knowledge here is not independent permission for a student to administer it.
学校可能在实操考核周之前教授药物知识。本课知识不等于学生获准独立给药。

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:52.776
All calculation cases here are original simulation exercises, not prescriptions or school examination answers. Practise the reasoning, preparation check and response assessment together.
本课计算均为原创模拟练习，不是处方，也不是学校考试答案。应同时练习推理、准备核对及反应评估。

00:00:52.776 --> 00:01:04.536
Naloxone competitively blocks opioid effects. It is used for suspected opioid-related respiratory depression, not as a universal treatment for every unresponsive person.
纳洛酮竞争性阻断阿片作用，用于疑似阿片相关呼吸抑制，不是所有无反应者的通用治疗。

00:01:04.536 --> 00:01:16.968
A patient with poor breathing needs airway and ventilation support immediately while naloxone is prepared. Waiting for a drug response while ventilation remains inadequate is not airway-first care.
呼吸不佳者在准备纳洛酮时就需要立即支持气道通气。通气不足却等待药物反应，不是气道优先。

00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:29.856
Assess spontaneous respiratory effort, depth, air movement, mentation and relevant monitoring after each action. The goal is effective breathing, not necessarily full alertness.
每次行动后评估自发呼吸、深度、气流、意识及相关监测。目标是有效呼吸，不一定完全清醒。

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:43.032
Pinpoint pupils may support suspicion but do not establish the diagnosis, and their absence does not exclude opioid involvement. Consider glucose, trauma, stroke and co-exposures.
针尖瞳孔可支持怀疑，但不确诊；没有针尖瞳孔也不排除阿片作用。应考虑血糖、创伤、卒中及混合暴露。

00:01:43.032 --> 00:01:55.896
The current PCP adult schedule gives point four milligrams, then point four, then point eight, then two, by the listed intramuscular or intravenous routes at three-minute intervals as required.
现行 PCP 成人方案按需要每三分钟，以所列肌内或静脉途径依次给零点四、零点四、零点八、二毫克。

00:01:55.896 --> 00:02:09.072
The fourth dose prefers the intravenous route, and further doses require CliniCall consultation first. The source phrase point four repeated four times is not an accurate description of the escalating schedule.
第四次优先静脉，更多剂量前须 CliniCall 咨询。来源中“零点四重复四次”的表述，不能准确描述递增方案。

00:02:09.072 --> 00:02:20.568
Check concentration every time. A point four milligram dose is one millilitre at point four milligrams per millilitre, but point four millilitres at one milligram per millilitre.
每次核对浓度。零点四毫克若浓度每毫升零点四毫克，需要一毫升；若每毫升一毫克，则需要零点四毫升。

00:02:20.568 --> 00:02:38.928
The public pediatric section lists weight-based IM dosing at point one milligram per kilogram, maximum two milligrams per dose, repeated every three minutes up to four doses under its labeled license section. Do not infer a pediatric IV authorization from the adult line.
公开儿科部分在其标注执照层级下列肌内每公斤零点一毫克，单次最多二毫克，每三分钟重复，最多四次。不能从成人静脉条目推导儿科静脉权限。

00:02:38.928 --> 00:02:53.136
Abrupt reversal can cause withdrawal, agitation, vomiting and cardiovascular changes. Prepare to protect the airway, maintain scene safety and reassess rather than assuming awakening completes care.
突然逆转可能引起戒断、躁动、呕吐及心血管变化。应准备保护气道、维持安全并复评，不能认为醒来就完成照护。

00:02:53.136 --> 00:03:07.656
The monograph gives an onset around one to three minutes and a duration around thirty to forty-five minutes for its IM or IV use. Many opioids outlast it, so recurrent respiratory depression remains possible.
专论给肌内或静脉起效约一至三分钟、作用约三十至四十五分钟。许多阿片持续更久，因此仍可能再次呼吸抑制。

00:03:07.656 --> 00:03:23.952
The listed contraindications include hypersensitivity and neonates. Palliative-care reversal is separately cautious, with the source describing point one milligram IM or IV per minute titration to breathing while preserving analgesia.
所列禁忌包括过敏及新生儿。姑息照护逆转需特别谨慎，来源描述肌内或静脉每分钟零点一毫克滴定至呼吸改善，同时保留镇痛。

00:03:23.952 --> 00:03:36.144
Use the appropriate clinical plan and consultation for the individual situation. A printed duration is not a safe discharge timer, and a temporary response does not exclude another cause.
应按个人情况使用适当临床计划及咨询。印出的作用时长不是安全离院计时器，暂时反应也不能排除其他原因。

00:03:36.144 --> 00:03:50.208
Acetylsalicylic acid reduces platelet aggregation through irreversible cyclooxygenase inhibition. It helps limit further thrombotic activity; it is not a clot-dissolving drug or a treatment for every chest symptom.
乙酰水杨酸通过不可逆环氧化酶抑制，降低血小板聚集，帮助限制进一步血栓活动；它不是溶栓药，也不是所有胸部症状治疗。

00:03:50.208 --> 00:04:01.464
The adult monograph lists one hundred and sixty-two milligrams orally, chewed and swallowed. Two eighty-one-milligram tablets provide that amount when the product is appropriate.
成人专论列口服一百六十二毫克，嚼碎后吞咽。适当产品的两片八十一毫克片剂提供该量。

00:04:01.464 --> 00:04:14.424
Verify the ischemic indication and what has already been taken for this event. Check the current ACS pathway rather than giving an unverified extra dose solely because the ambulance has arrived.
核实缺血适应证及本次事件已服剂量。应查现行 ACS 路径，不能只因救护车到了就未经核实再加一剂。

00:04:14.424 --> 00:04:27.504
Confirm that oral administration is safe and document time, dose and response. Continue cardiac assessment and the transport pathway; giving ASA does not complete ACS care.
确认口服安全，记录时间、剂量及反应。继续心脏评估与转运路径；给 ASA 不等于完成 ACS 照护。

00:04:27.504 --> 00:04:38.688
Ask about the actual reaction to ASA or related drugs. A history of drug-triggered bronchospasm is more specific than simply noting that the patient has asthma.
询问 ASA 或相关药物实际反应。药物诱发支气管痉挛史，比只记录患者有哮喘更具体。

00:04:38.688 --> 00:04:54.912
The monograph excludes active or recent bleeding, including relevant head injury and peptic ulcer disease. Clarify the history and seek clinical guidance when the significance is uncertain rather than making an unsupported yes-or-no assumption.
专论排除活动或近期出血，包括相关头部损伤及消化性溃疡病。应澄清病史，意义不确定时求临床指导，而不是无依据地判有无。

00:04:54.912 --> 00:05:08.544
Pediatric administration requires prior CliniCall consultation and a rare appropriate indication; a viral illness raises the listed Reye syndrome concern. Consultation is not itself an indication.
儿科给药需事先 CliniCall 咨询，并有罕见适当适应证；病毒疾病涉及所列 Reye 综合征风险。咨询本身不是适应证。

00:05:08.544 --> 00:05:21.912
Record other antiplatelet or anticoagulant exposure and communicate risk. Do not claim that a drug's platelet effect ending with platelet turnover is the same as its shorter symptomatic effects.
记录其他抗血小板或抗凝暴露并交接风险。不能把随血小板更新才结束的作用，与较短的症状作用时长混为一谈。

00:05:21.912 --> 00:05:36.528
Dimenhydrinate reduces nausea through vestibular and central antihistaminic and anticholinergic effects. Continue looking for the cause of vomiting, especially if severe pain, neurological change or shock is present.
茶苯海明通过前庭及中枢抗组胺、抗胆碱作用减轻恶心。仍需寻找呕吐原因，尤其伴剧痛、神经改变或休克时。

00:05:36.528 --> 00:05:51.000
The current monograph distinguishes first-line motion, vertigo, pregnancy or ondansetron-contraindication contexts from second-line long-transport nausea after ondansetron has been ineffective for fifteen to thirty minutes.
现行专论区分晕动、眩晕、妊娠或昂丹司琼禁忌时一线，以及长途转运中昂丹司琼十五至三十分钟无效后的二线。

00:05:51.000 --> 00:06:07.488
The adult dose is twenty-five to fifty milligrams IV or IM every four to six hours as needed. For someone over sixty-five or frail, the listed dose is twelve point five milligrams because higher doses increase delirium risk.
成人按需每四至六小时静脉或肌内二十五至五十毫克。超过六十五岁或虚弱者列十二点五毫克，因为更高剂量增加谵妄风险。

00:06:07.488 --> 00:06:19.272
The public pediatric dosing section is labeled ACP. Do not convert the school's under-twelve restriction into an assumption of unrestricted PCP dosing for every older child.
公开儿科给药部分标注 ACP。不能把学校“十二岁以下受限”转换成所有更大儿童均可不受限由 PCP 给药。

00:06:19.272 --> 00:06:33.552
For the listed fifty-milligram-per-millilitre ampoule, one millilitre plus nine millilitres saline gives a final ten millilitres at five milligrams per millilitre. Distinguish added diluent from final total volume.
所列每毫升五十毫克安瓿，一毫升药加九毫升盐水，最终十毫升、每毫升五毫克。应区分加入稀释液体积与最终总体积。

00:06:33.552 --> 00:06:50.280
In this simulation, twelve point five milligrams corresponds to two point five millilitres of that prepared concentration. The monograph IV rate is twenty-five milligrams per minute; this is a rate limit, not permission for a rapid push.
本模拟中，该配制浓度的十二点五毫克对应二点五毫升。专论静脉速率为每分钟二十五毫克；这是速率要求，不是允许快速猛推。

00:06:50.280 --> 00:07:04.152
Check sensitivity to the listed drug families and use caution with elevated ocular pressure or prostatic hypertrophy. Sedation, dizziness, dry mouth and urinary retention are important adverse effects.
核查对所列药物家族过敏，眼压升高或前列腺肥大需谨慎。镇静、头晕、口干及尿潴留是重要不良反应。

00:07:04.152 --> 00:07:17.088
Alcohol, benzodiazepines and other depressants can increase sedation. Reduced nausea with worsening alertness is not an uncomplicated success; repeat the full relevant assessment.
酒精、苯二氮䓬及其他抑制剂可加重镇静。恶心减少但清醒下降，不是无并发症成功，应重复完整相关评估。

00:07:17.088 --> 00:07:28.680
Tranexamic acid limits fibrin breakdown, helping preserve clots. It does not seal a severed artery, supply blood volume or replace timely definitive hemorrhage control.
氨甲环酸限制纤维蛋白降解，帮助保留血栓。它不封闭断裂动脉、不补回血容量，也不能代替及时确定性止血。

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:41.976
The PCP trauma indication combines shock or hypoperfusion with an injury suggesting concealed or ongoing bleeding. A low pressure without that injury context is not enough to establish the indication.
PCP 创伤适应证需要休克或低灌注，加上提示隐藏或持续出血的损伤。没有损伤背景的低血压，不足以确立适应证。

00:07:41.976 --> 00:07:55.104
Continue immediate hemorrhage control, reassessment, appropriate resuscitation and urgent transport. Preparing a drug must not distract the team from an uncontrolled bleed or unsafe delay.
继续即时止血、复评、适当复苏及紧急转运。准备药物不能分散团队对失控出血或不安全延误的注意。

00:07:55.104 --> 00:08:05.520
Maternal vaginal bleeding after twenty weeks or postpartum hemorrhage with shock or hypoperfusion is listed separately and requires prior CliniCall consultation.
二十周后孕产妇阴道出血或产后出血，伴休克或低灌注，是另列适应证，且须事先 CliniCall 咨询。

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:16.800
Check injury time against the actual planned administration time. More than three hours, hypersensitivity and non-traumatic gastrointestinal hemorrhage are listed exclusions.
对照真正计划给药时间核实受伤时间。超过三小时、过敏及非创伤性胃肠出血是所列排除项。

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:31.584
The current PCP monograph excludes age below twelve. Its adult regimen is two grams intravenously over one minute. Younger-child dosing appears in the ACP section and is not a new PCP permission.
现行 PCP 专论排除十二岁以下，成人方案静脉两克、一分钟给予。更小儿童给药出现在 ACP 部分，并非新增 PCP 权限。

00:08:31.584 --> 00:08:49.704
School 7D contrasts the legacy one gram over ten minutes, followed by one gram over eight hours, with the revised two grams over one minute. These are different named regimens, not interchangeable rates. Do not combine them or administer both to be safe.
学校 7D 对比旧方案：一克十分钟给完，随后一克八小时输注；以及修订方案：两克一分钟给予。这些是不同的具名方案，不是可互换速率。不能把它们合并，也不能为“保险”而两者都给。

00:08:49.704 --> 00:09:02.784
For an examination, identify which named source and version the question specifies and clarify unresolved differences with the instructor. Documentation does not make a wrong regimen correct.
考试中应识别题目指定的来源和版本，未解决差异向教师澄清。记录下来，并不能把错误方案变正确。

00:09:02.784 --> 00:09:16.368
At one hundred milligrams per millilitre, two grams is two thousand milligrams and requires twenty millilitres. Check the actual vial concentration and number of containers rather than relying on their appearance.
浓度每毫升一百毫克时，两克是两千毫克，需要二十毫升。应核查真实瓶浓度及瓶数，不能只凭外观。

00:09:16.368 --> 00:09:28.200
The listed route is intravenous, not intramuscular or subcutaneous. The one-minute administration period matters: too-rapid administration can worsen hypotension.
所列途径为静脉，不是肌内或皮下。一分钟给药时长很重要；过快可加重低血压。

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:42.840
Verify line patency and continue monitoring perfusion and bleeding. Record injury time, indication, eligibility checks, dose, route, start and completion times, response and any consultation.
确认通路通畅，持续监测灌注及出血。记录受伤时间、适应证、条件核对、剂量、途径、开始和结束时间、反应及咨询。

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:53.712
This is a preparation calculation for the cited current BCEHS regimen, not a universal manufacturer instruction. Use the governing authorized plan for the actual setting.
这是所引现行 BCEHS 方案的配制计算，不是统一厂家指示。实际场景必须遵守适用获准计划。

00:09:53.712 --> 00:10:05.088
Write the unit beside every quantity. One gram is one thousand milligrams and one milligram is one thousand micrograms; confusing these creates a thousand-fold error.
每个量旁边都写单位。一克是一千毫克，一毫克是一千微克，混淆会造成千倍错误。

00:10:05.088 --> 00:10:15.072
To obtain volume, divide the required mass by concentration after making the mass units agree. The mass units cancel and millilitres remain.
求体积时，先统一质量单位，再用所需质量除浓度。质量单位抵消，留下毫升。

00:10:15.072 --> 00:10:25.464
Then consider time separately. Knowing that twenty millilitres is the correct dose volume does not tell you whether it should run in one minute, ten minutes or hours.
然后单独考虑时间。知道正确剂量体积是二十毫升，并不能说明该在一分钟、十分钟还是数小时内给完。

00:10:25.464 --> 00:10:38.448
Check plausibility and obtain the required independent verification before a simulated administration. Correct arithmetic cannot repair a wrong indication, drug, route or source version.
模拟给药前核查合理性，并按要求独立复核。正确算术不能修复错误适应证、药物、途径或来源版本。

00:10:38.448 --> 00:10:49.800
Drop factor is how many drops the set delivers per millilitre under its stated conditions. It is a property of the actual tubing, not a number chosen to simplify arithmetic.
滴系数是该输液器在规定条件下每毫升多少滴，属于真实管路属性，不是为了好算而选的数字。

00:10:49.800 --> 00:11:02.016
Macrodrip sets commonly use ten, fifteen or twenty drops per millilitre; microdrip commonly uses sixty. Read the label and verify the selected set before calculating.
大滴输液器常见每毫升十、十五或二十滴，微滴常见六十。计算前读标识并核实所用器材。

00:11:02.016 --> 00:11:15.984
A microdrip set creates smaller drops but does not automatically make every pediatric or high-risk infusion safe. Required precision, drug, patient and local procedure determine suitable equipment.
微滴输液器滴更小，但不自动让所有儿科或高风险输注安全。所需精度、药物、患者及当地规程决定适当设备。

00:11:15.984 --> 00:11:25.704
Gravity flow changes with height, position, resistance and movement. A calculated clamp setting requires repeated actual delivery checks.
重力流量会随高度、位置、阻力及移动变化。算出的夹管设置，需要反复检查实际输送。

00:11:25.704 --> 00:11:36.312
Multiply the volume in millilitres by the set factor in drops per millilitre, then divide by time in minutes. Millilitres cancel, leaving drops per minute.
毫升体积乘每毫升滴数，再除分钟时间。毫升抵消，留下每分钟滴数。

00:11:36.312 --> 00:11:46.392
Convert hours to minutes before using that formula. Entering one point five hours as one point five minutes creates a sixty-fold flow error.
代入公式前把小时换成分钟。把一点五小时当一点五分钟，会造成六十倍流量错误。

00:11:46.392 --> 00:11:56.424
Retain precision during intermediate calculations and round the final result to a whole drop. You cannot reliably set a fraction of a gravity drop.
中间计算保留精度，最终每分钟滴数才取整。重力滴注无法可靠设置半滴。

00:11:56.424 --> 00:12:07.416
Finally estimate whether the result makes sense for the prescribed volume and time. If it seems extreme, check units, factor and order before any setup.
最后估算结果是否符合指定体积和时间。若极端，先核对单位、滴系数及医嘱，再设置。

00:12:07.416 --> 00:12:18.864
For this original simulation, four hundred millilitres is prescribed over ninety minutes using a fifteen-drop-per-millilitre set. All required units are already compatible.
这个原创模拟要求四百毫升、九十分钟，用每毫升十五滴输液器。所需单位已经相容。

00:12:18.864 --> 00:12:28.944
Four hundred multiplied by fifteen, divided by ninety, gives sixty-six point six seven drops per minute. Round the final value to sixty-seven.
四百乘十五除九十，得每分钟六十六点六七滴，最终取整六十七。

00:12:28.944 --> 00:12:40.920
A reverse check gives approximately four point four four millilitres each minute, or two hundred and sixty-seven each hour. That is consistent with four hundred over one and a half hours.
反查约每分钟四点四四毫升、每小时二百六十七毫升，与一点五小时四百毫升一致。

00:12:40.920 --> 00:12:53.016
Set the actual drip chamber count, verify delivery and monitor the patient and site. This example teaches rate calculation, not whether four hundred millilitres is clinically appropriate.
实际计数滴斗、核实输送，并监测患者及局部。本例教速率计算，不判断四百毫升临床上是否适当。

00:12:53.016 --> 00:13:03.288
For ninety millilitres over forty-five minutes with a sixty-drop set, ninety times sixty divided by forty-five gives one hundred and twenty drops per minute.
九十毫升、四十五分钟、六十滴输液器，九十乘六十除四十五，得每分钟一百二十滴。

00:13:03.288 --> 00:13:16.200
The equivalent volume rate is two millilitres per minute or one hundred and twenty millilitres per hour. With a sixty-drop set only, the numeric drops-per-minute and millilitres-per-hour values match.
对应每分钟两毫升，或每小时一百二十毫升。仅在六十滴输液器时，每分钟滴数与每小时毫升数的数字相同。

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:24.216
Do not apply that shortcut to a fifteen-drop set. Its drop count would be one quarter as large for the same volume flow.
不能把这个捷径用于十五滴输液器。同样体积流量时，滴数只有前者四分之一。

00:13:24.216 --> 00:13:33.552
A large count can be hard to control manually. The correct calculation does not remove the need for suitable delivery equipment and close observation.
较高滴数可能难以手动控制。计算正确，仍不能免去适当输送设备及密切观察。

00:13:33.552 --> 00:13:42.408
If the volume rate is already millilitres per hour, multiply by the tubing factor and divide by sixty to convert hours to minutes.
医嘱已经是每小时毫升时，乘管路滴系数，再除六十，把小时换分钟。

00:13:42.408 --> 00:13:54.312
For one hundred and twenty millilitres per hour with a fifteen-drop set, the result is thirty drops per minute. Check by dividing thirty by fifteen: two millilitres per minute.
每小时一百二十毫升，十五滴输液器，得每分钟三十滴。反查三十除十五，为每分钟两毫升。

00:13:54.312 --> 00:14:04.272
The pump setting for that same volume flow would be one hundred and twenty millilitres per hour, not thirty. Always read the displayed unit before entering a number.
相同体积流量在泵上应设每小时一百二十毫升，不是三十。输入数字前必须读显示单位。

00:14:04.272 --> 00:14:17.040
If a medication rate is given as mass per minute, first convert through the actual prepared concentration to volume per minute. Never substitute mass directly into a volume-flow formula.
药物速率为每分钟质量时，先通过真实配制浓度换成每分钟体积。不能把质量直接代入体积流量公式。

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:27.480
Suppose you observe forty drops per minute through a set labeled twenty drops per millilitre. Divide forty by twenty to obtain two millilitres per minute.
假设实际每分钟四十滴，输液器标每毫升二十滴。四十除二十，得每分钟两毫升。

00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:40.248
At an unchanged rate for twenty-five minutes, the calculated volume is fifty millilitres. Verify with the actual fluid container and clinical record; gravity rates are not perfectly constant.
若二十五分钟内速率不变，计算体积五十毫升。仍需与实际液体容器及记录核对，因为重力流量并非完全恒定。

00:14:40.248 --> 00:14:52.176
If you mistakenly used a ten-drop factor, you would estimate four millilitres per minute and one hundred millilitres delivered. A wrong factor can corrupt both setup and documentation.
若误用十滴系数，会估成每分钟四毫升、已输一百毫升。滴系数错误会同时破坏设置和记录。

00:14:52.176 --> 00:15:01.872
Use reverse checks to investigate inconsistencies. Do not edit the record to match an expected volume when the actual delivery remains uncertain.
用反算调查矛盾。实际输送仍不确定时，不能把记录改成预期体积。

00:15:01.872 --> 00:15:15.192
Gravity flow can change when the patient moves, the bag height changes, the line bends or the ambulance starts moving. Recount and inspect rather than assuming the first clamp position remains correct.
患者移动、液袋高度改变、管路弯折或车辆启动，均可改变重力流量。应重新计数检查，不能假定初始夹位一直正确。

00:15:15.192 --> 00:15:28.296
Check for pain, swelling, leakage, occlusion and a disconnected line. If a complication is suspected, stop or modify delivery according to the appropriate procedure and seek help.
检查疼痛、肿胀、渗漏、堵塞及管路断开。疑似并发症时，按相应规程停止或调整输送并求助。

00:15:28.296 --> 00:15:41.184
Assess whether the therapy is helping and whether it is causing harm, including worsening breathing or fluid-overload signs when relevant. The correct rate for a previous plan may be wrong after the patient changes.
评估治疗是否有效及是否有害，相关时注意呼吸变差或液体负荷过多。患者变化后，原计划正确速率也可能不再合适。

00:15:41.184 --> 00:15:53.400
Document the actual volume, rate, changes and response. Include what remains uncertain rather than converting a theoretical calculation into a falsely exact delivered amount.
记录实际体积、速率、改变及反应。注明仍不确定内容，不能把理论计算冒充精确已输体积。

00:15:53.400 --> 00:16:05.760
Read the complete order, product and units before calculating. Use a leading zero for a value below one, and avoid an unnecessary trailing zero that could be read as a larger dose.
计算前完整读医嘱、产品及单位。小于一使用前导零，避免不必要尾随零被误读成更大剂量。

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:17.328
Write a dimensional calculation and perform an approximate plausibility check. A tiny ampoule cannot reasonably provide a huge calculated volume without prompting a recheck.
写出量纲计算并做近似合理性核查。小安瓿却算出巨大体积，应立刻复核。

00:16:17.328 --> 00:16:28.776
Have the required second checker independently assess the indication, product, calculation and route. Simply repeating your answer back is not an independent verification.
按要求让第二核查者独立评估适应证、产品、计算和途径。只是复述你的答案，不叫独立复核。

00:16:28.776 --> 00:16:40.320
If the order, source or label is unclear, pause the nonessential drug step and clarify while maintaining needed patient support. Do not guess to keep a station moving.
医嘱、来源或标识不清时，应暂停非必要药物步骤并澄清，同时维持必要患者支持。不能为了让练习继续而猜。

00:16:40.320 --> 00:16:53.688
This original scenario tests monitoring after medication. Less nausea is only one outcome; worsening alertness may indicate an adverse effect, an error or progression of the underlying illness.
原创情景考查给药后监测。恶心减轻只是一个结果；清醒下降可能是不良反应、错误或基础病进展。

00:16:53.688 --> 00:17:05.976
Return to immediate clinical priorities and verify breathing, circulation and glucose as appropriate. In parallel, review what was actually administered, not just the planned dose.
回到即时临床优先，按需核实呼吸、循环及血糖。同时复查真实给了什么，而不是只看计划剂量。

00:17:05.976 --> 00:17:17.712
Inspect the preparation and record, and ask about alcohol, benzodiazepines or other depressants. Do not anchor on the medication if another dangerous cause fits the findings.
检查配制和记录，询问酒精、苯二氮䓬或其他抑制剂。若其他危险原因符合发现，不能只锚定药物。

00:17:17.712 --> 00:17:29.376
Escalate and communicate the before-and-after observations, timing, drug details and interventions. The receiving clinician needs both the apparent benefit and the new risk.
升级并交接前后观察、时间、药物细节及干预。接收医护人员既需要知道表面益处，也需要知道新风险。

00:17:29.376 --> 00:17:42.384
For each school medication, explain why it would or would not fit an original patient example. State the mechanism in a sentence and identify the exclusion that matters most in that case.
对每种学校药物，解释为何适合或不适合一个原创患者示例。用一句话说机制，并指出该例最重要排除项。

00:17:42.384 --> 00:17:54.912
Then calculate from an actual labeled simulated product. Show units, concentration, volume and time, and have the required independent check before a supervised practice action.
再依据有真实标识的模拟产品计算。写单位、浓度、体积和时间，在督导实操前完成要求的独立核对。

00:17:54.912 --> 00:18:07.008
After the instructor introduces a response or complication, reassess and explain your next action. A correct initial calculation does not guarantee a safe completed intervention.
教师加入反应或并发症后，复评并解释下一步。初始计算正确，不保证整项干预安全完成。

00:18:07.008 --> 00:18:21.696
This completes the substantive monitoring, medication and infusion teaching domains in school 7D Part A. The separate school readings and practical verification remain additional requirements, not automatically passed by listening.
至此覆盖学校 7D Part A 的实质监测、药物和输注教学领域。另列学校阅读及实操核验仍是额外要求，不能因听完就算通过。
